  "chain": "personnel error / procedure use and adherence failure [cause A] -> 2 of 4 SIAS sensor modules sense low pressurizer pressure condition -> unplanned SIAS A and B actuation -> automatic start of 2A DG and 2B DG (no-load, secured normally) -> reset successfully, no safety injection occurred, SDC unaffected",
