  ],
  "notes": "Event occurred in Mode 5 with HPSI LTOP tagout and both LPSI pumps already running SDC, so despite the unplanned SIAS, no actual safety injection occurred and SDC was unaffected; DGs auto-started but never loaded onto their buses (no undervoltage condition) and were later secured normally, so this is modeled as a mitigated consequence rather than a true backup system relationship. No component failures were identified (Section H), consistent with cause code A / personnel error and no block-13 system/component codes. Previous occurrence LER 318-2021-004 is a stub per explicit narrative reference; it is a different type of personnel-error event (arc-flash/breaker) and not an ESFAS actuation, but the narrative explicitly ties it in as the closest previous occurrence."
